WEBVTT

00:00:00.337 --> 00:00:04.767
Supplier raised prices? The <b>wholesale price</b> is adjusted from the register too

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:08.388
Open the product details

00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:13.282
Tap <b>Actualizar precio</b> (update price) and type the administrator's PIN

00:00:13.432 --> 00:00:18.502
Below the price you'll see its <b>wholesale price</b>

00:00:18.549 --> 00:00:20.732
Raise the regular price

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:24.582
And the wholesale one, so it doesn't fall behind

00:00:24.631 --> 00:00:29.049
From <b>25 pieces</b> on, the new wholesale price applies
